.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK BULK CREATE"
.SH NAME
hamstik work bulk create \- Create up to 50 work items in one request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work bulk create [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create up to 50 work items in one request
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --operations-file
Operations as a JSON array file (path, or - for stdin)
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context; used to validate access)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
